<title>
Precautions for Replacing ISG
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
 After ISG is replaced with new one, perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AA306003">ECM / ISG Registration</intxref>
 using SUZUKI scan tool.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
When ISG and BCM are replaced at the same time, perform 
<intxref refid = "AENLSB0AA206002">BCM Registration</intxref>
 for their registration.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
